---
import { budaCastleImage, parliamentImage } from "../data/images"
---

<section
  class="relative overflow-hidden bg-inverted py-section palette-surface-primary"
  aria-labelledby="buda-pest-heading"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-landing px-container-x sm:px-8 xl:px-14">
    <p
      class="reveal mb-6 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-inverted-foreground/50"
    >
      Two cities
    </p>

    <h2
      id="buda-pest-heading"
      class="reveal max-w-heading font-display text-headline-1 font-bold leading-[1.05] text-inverted-foreground"
    >
      Buda / Pest
    </h2>

    <p
      class="reveal mt-6 max-w-copy text-base leading-relaxed text-inverted-foreground/60 sm:text-lg"
    >
      Before 1873, they were separate cities. Buda, on the hills to the west —
      royal, ancient, fortified. Pest, on the plains to the east — commercial,
      cosmopolitan, expanding. The Danube ran between them like a sentence that
      connected two paragraphs of the same story.
    </p>

    <!-- Split-screen Buda/Pest -->
    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-8 sm:mt-20 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-6">
      <!-- Buda side -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <figure>
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-sm">
            <img
              src={`${budaCastleImage.src}&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80`}
              srcset={`${budaCastleImage.src}&w=500&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80 500w, ${budaCastleImage.src}&w=700&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80 700w, ${budaCastleImage.src}&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80 900w`}
              sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 90vw, 45vw"
              alt={budaCastleImage.alt}
              title={`Photo by ${budaCastleImage.author} on Unsplash`}
              width={budaCastleImage.width}
              height={budaCastleImage.height}
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              class="photo-tone aspect-[3/4] w-full object-cover"
            />
          </div>
          <figcaption class="mt-3 text-xs text-inverted-foreground/40">
            Photo by <a
              href={budaCastleImage.authorUrl}
              class="underline hover:text-inverted-foreground/60"
              rel="noopener">{budaCastleImage.author}</a
            >
            on <a
              href={budaCastleImage.unsplashUrl}
              class="underline hover:text-inverted-foreground/60"
              rel="noopener">Unsplash</a
            >
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h3
          class="mt-6 font-display text-headline-2 font-bold text-inverted-foreground"
        >
          Buda
        </h3>
        <p
          class="mt-3 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-inverted-foreground/50"
        >
          Hills, castle, cobblestone. The medieval fortress district, Gellert
          Hill, and the winding paths of a city that remembers its
          fortifications, its monarchs, and the view from above.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pest side -->
      <div class="reveal lg:mt-16">
        <figure>
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-sm">
            <img
              src={`${parliamentImage.src}&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80`}
              srcset={`${parliamentImage.src}&w=500&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80 500w, ${parliamentImage.src}&w=700&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80 700w, ${parliamentImage.src}&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80 900w`}
              sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 90vw, 45vw"
              alt={parliamentImage.alt}
              title={`Photo by ${parliamentImage.author} on Unsplash`}
              width={parliamentImage.width}
              height={parliamentImage.height}
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              class="photo-tone aspect-[3/4] w-full object-cover"
            />
          </div>
          <figcaption class="mt-3 text-xs text-inverted-foreground/40">
            Photo by <a
              href={parliamentImage.authorUrl}
              class="underline hover:text-inverted-foreground/60"
              rel="noopener">{parliamentImage.author}</a
            >
            on <a
              href={parliamentImage.unsplashUrl}
              class="underline hover:text-inverted-foreground/60"
              rel="noopener">Unsplash</a
            >
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h3
          class="mt-6 font-display text-headline-2 font-bold text-inverted-foreground"
        >
          Pest
        </h3>
        <p
          class="mt-3 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-inverted-foreground/50"
        >
          Avenues, Parliament, cafes. The flat eastern bank where grand
          boulevards radiate from the Danube, where the Opera House stands
          between two centuries, and where conversations never stop.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial quote -->
    <blockquote
      class="reveal mt-20 border-l-2 border-inverted-foreground/10 pl-6 sm:mt-28"
    >
      <p
        class="font-display text-headline-3 font-bold italic leading-snug text-inverted-foreground/80"
      >
        "The Danube doesn't divide Budapest. It tells its story."
      </p>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>
